+Fix I would make:
+
+Use the live Aave receipt balance as the vault's asset base, or otherwise keep retained fees in accounting. If the intended design is "fees accrue to remaining shareholders", withdrawals should remove only `netAssets` from Aave/accounting after burning shares, leaving the fee inside the asset base for the remaining shares. Also define what happens when the last shareholder withdraws, because retained fees with zero shares otherwise become orphaned.
